    "Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inställningar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shopping & other": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shopping och övrigt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows three periods of made-up Swedish transactions. Your real data is untouched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Visar tre perioder med påhittade svenska transaktioner. Din riktiga data rörs inte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in with your email, then add a new application in the Production environment, not Sandbox.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Logga in med din e-post och lägg sedan till en ny applikation i miljön Production, inte Sandbox."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Signed requests for your bank list, your accounts and your transactions. Enable Banking is a licensed open banking provider in Finland and relays these to your bank. The requests carry your phone's IP address and the app name, which Enable Banking keeps in its logs for a time it does not publish.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Signerade anrop efter banklistan, dina konton och dina transaktioner. Enable Banking är en licensierad open banking-leverantör i Finland och vidarebefordrar dem till din bank. Anropen innehåller telefonens IP-adress och appens namn, som Enable Banking sparar i sina loggar under en tid de inte publicerar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Something went wrong": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Något gick fel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Source code": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Källkod"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spent so far": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spenderat hittills"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streaming": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Streaming"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Student loan (CSN)": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Studielån (CSN)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subscriptions": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prenumerationer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Takeaway & restaurants": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hämtmat och restaurang"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Enable Banking session id and your Application ID, in the Keychain, device only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enable Bankings sessions-id och ditt applikations-ID, i nyckelringen, bara på den här enheten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The amount is the quarterly total. A third is set aside each period.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beloppet är kvartalssumman. En tredjedel avsätts varje period."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app contains no other network code. iOS App Privacy Report shows every domain it has contacted; try it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appen innehåller ingen annan nätverkskod. iOS Appintegritetsrapport visar varje domän den har kontaktat. Prova."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The application will show as Restricted and Active. That is the free personal mode.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applikationen visas som Restricted och Active. Det är det kostnadsfria personliga läget."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bank is rate limiting requests. Try again in a few hours.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Banken begränsar antalet anrop. Försök igen om några timmar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The login response did not match this app's request. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inloggningssvaret matchade inte appens begäran. Försök igen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The private half was created inside this phone and cannot be exported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Den privata halvan skapades inuti telefonen och kan inte exporteras."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The private key is protected by the Keychain and your passcode, not by the Secure Enclave, because Enable Banking requires RSA. Enable Banking can see which accounts you access and when. The source code is public so all of this can be checked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Den privata nyckeln skyddas av nyckelringen och din lösenkod, inte av Secure Enclave, eftersom Enable Banking kräver RSA. Enable Banking kan se vilka konton du hämtar och när. Källkoden är öppen så att allt detta kan kontrolleras."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This bank needs it to start BankID. It is sent once and never stored.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Banken behöver det för att starta BankID. Det skickas en gång och sparas aldrig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This period started on": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Perioden började den"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes your real bank data too, not only the sample. It cannot be undone. Your Enable Banking application stays in their control panel; delete it there too if you are done.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Det här tar även bort din riktiga bankdata, inte bara exempeldatan. Det går inte att ångra. Din applikation hos Enable Banking finns kvar i deras kontrollpanel. Radera den där också om du är klar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tjugofemte": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tjugofemte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tjugofemte is a budgeting app with no company behind the data. There is no server, no account, no analytics, no advertising kit. Your bank history is downloaded by your phone, from your bank, through a connection you own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tjugofemte är en budgetapp utan något företag bakom datan. Det finns ingen server, inget konto, ingen analys, inget annonsverktyg. Din bankhistorik hämtas av din telefon, från din bank, genom en koppling du själv äger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tjugofemte never sees your bank data. You create your own free connection at Enable Banking, and this phone talks to the bank directly. The steps below take about ten minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tjugofemte ser aldrig din bankdata. Du skapar en egen kostnadsfri koppling hos Enable Banking och telefonen pratar direkt med banken. Stegen nedan tar ungefär tio minuter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To api.enablebanking.com": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Till api.enablebanking.com"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To your bank and BankID": {
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Till din bank och BankID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
